{"Export current wavefield snapshot (.vti)","导出当前波场快照（.vti）"},
{"Exports the selected physical component at native grid resolution and current simulation time. Display gain and palette do not change saved values.","以原始网格分辨率导出当前时刻选中的物理分量。显示增益和色带不会改变导出数值。"},
