{"Create session subfolder","创建会话子文件夹"},
{"Current prefix: %s","当前文件名前缀：%s"},
{"Output: prefix_0001_vx.sgy / vy.sgy / vz.sgy and prefix_0001_geometry.csv. Existing files are preserved.","输出：前缀_0001_vx.sgy、vy.sgy、vz.sgy 和 前缀_0001_geometry.csv；已有文件不会被覆盖。"},
{"With session subfolders off, files are written directly into the selected export folder.","关闭会话子文件夹后，文件直接写入所选导出文件夹。"},
{"A single X line is centered in Y. 100 distinct X receivers require at least 102 X nodes; smaller grids reduce the fitted count.","单排 X 向接收线位于 Y 中线。100 个独立接收点至少需要 102 个 X 向格点；较小网格会减少适配道数。"},
