{"Open 3D sandbox","进入三维沙盒"},
{"Quick start","快速开始"},
{"Model and boundaries","模型与边界"},
{"Source and acquisition","震源与采集"},
{"Wavefield and traces","波场与地震记录"},
{"Import and export","导入与导出"},
{"Mouse and troubleshooting","鼠标操作与排查"},
{"3-SLICE / 100 RECEIVERS / SCHEMATIC","三剖面 / 100 道接收 / 示意图"},
{"MODEL / SOURCE / ACQUISITION / DISPLAY / EXPORT","模型 / 震源 / 数据采集 / 可视化 / 文件导出"},
{"1. Enter the 3D sandbox","1. 进入三维沙盒"},
{"Choose the 3D card on Home. The initial grid is 128 x 96 x 96, with 100 surface receivers along X at the middle of Y. The initial view uses Vz, Geological layers and Coolwarm; Hold observed peak is off.","在首页选择三维沙盒。初始网格为 128×96×96，100 个地表接收点沿 X 方向排成一排，位于 Y 中线。初始显示为 Vz、地质分层和 Coolwarm，历史峰值保持关闭。"},
{"2. Initialize the model","2. 初始化模型"},
{"In Simulation, choose a model preset, grid spacing and boundary mode, then initialize or rebuild the session. Check the memory budget and safe time step before increasing the grid.","在模拟控制中选择模型预设、网格间距和边界模式，再初始化或重建会话。增大网格前，先检查显存预算和安全时间步。"},
{"3. Run or capture","3. 运行或采集"},
{"Run provides a live monitor. For an exportable shot, open Acquisition, deploy the receivers and choose Capture current source. Capturing restarts the wavefield and records Vx, Vy and Vz.","运行提供实时接收监测。需要可导出的单炮记录时，打开数据采集，部署接收排列并点击采集当前震源。采集会重新启动波场，同时记录 Vx、Vy 和 Vz。"},
{"4. Inspect and export","4. 查看与导出"},
{"Select a receiver or one receiver row. Adjust Trace gain or AGC to inspect weak arrivals. Choose the export folder and filename prefix, then export the captured three-component SEG-Y record.","选择单道或一排接收记录。通过波形增益或 AGC 查看弱到达信号。选择导出文件夹和文件名前缀，再导出已采集的三分量 SEG-Y 记录。"},
{"Choose the physical model","选择物理模型"},
{"Procedural presets define Vp, Vs and density. A VTI model replaces the physical grid and materials after complete geometry and material validation.","模型预设定义 Vp、Vs 和密度。VTI 模型经完整几何和物性校验后，替换物理网格与材料。"},
{"Choose the boundary mode","选择边界模式"},
{"Free surface plus CPML models a traction-free top and absorbing other faces. All absorbing CPML absorbs at all six faces. All reflecting walls returns wave energy from every face.","自由表面与 CPML 模式采用顶面零牵引力、其余面吸收；全吸收 CPML 在六个面吸收波场；全反射壁面将各面波动能量反射回模拟域。"},
{"Boundary visibility","边界层显示"},
{"Show boundary layer changes the visible region only. It does not enable or disable absorption. Rebuild the session to apply changes to the physical boundary mode or CPML thickness.","显示边界层仅改变可见范围，不控制吸收功能的启停。修改物理边界模式或 CPML 厚度后，需要重建会话。"},
{"Grid size and stability","网格尺寸与稳定性"},
{"The total physical cell budget is 300 x 300 x 400. The solver also checks padded allocation and VRAM. Safe dt is computed from maximum Vp, grid spacing and the spatial stencil.","物理格点总量上限为 300×300×400。求解器同时检查含扩展层的分配量和显存预算，并依据最大 Vp、网格间距和空间差分格式计算安全时间步。"},
{"Place the source","布设震源"},
{"In Source, set XYZ, source mechanism, amplitude and direction. Source depth must be at least two cells. Simulation controls contain the Ricker frequency.","在震源页设置 XYZ、激发机制、幅值和方向。震源深度至少为两个格点。Ricker 主频位于模拟控制中。"},
{"Deploy the receivers","部署接收排列"},
{"X line fits one row at the middle of Y; Y line fits one column at the middle of X. Grid presets create multiple rows. Fit spread updates editable positions; Deploy mesh applies them to the GPU.","X 向单排位于 Y 中线，Y 向单列位于 X 中线。网格预设可创建多排接收排列。适配模型只更新待编辑位置；部署接收排列才会应用到 GPU。"},
{"Record a shot","采集单炮"},
{"Set samples per shot and sample stride. Actual sample interval is shown in milliseconds. Capture current source creates a frozen record; Stop capture retains the partial record for inspection or export.","设置每炮样本数与采样步距，界面以毫秒显示实际采样间隔。采集当前震源生成固定记录；停止采集会保留已采样部分，供查看或导出。"},
{"Run a shot spread","执行多炮采集"},
{"Configure shots per line, source line count and spacing. Start spread captures and exports each shot in order. Each shot has its own number; validate the output location and prefix before starting.","设置每线炮数、震源线数与间距。启动多炮采集后依次采集并导出各炮，每炮有独立编号。开始前确认输出位置与文件名前缀。"},
{"Wavefield colors and scale","波场配色与幅值标度"},
{"Choose Vx, Vy, Vz, velocity magnitude or pressure. Visual preset changes palettes while preserving tuned gain and opacity. Reset display parameters is the explicit reset control. Wave gain and Trace gain are independent.","可以选择 Vx、Vy、Vz、速度模或压力。视觉预设切换配色并保留已调整的增益与透明度；重置显示参数用于主动恢复默认值。波场增益与波形增益相互独立。"},
{"Automatic scale and peak history","自动标度与历史峰值"},
{"With Hold observed peak off, colors track the current amplitude reference. Turn it on to keep a stable scale across time. Manual scale is useful when comparing amplitudes between runs.","关闭历史峰值保持时，颜色跟随当前幅值参考；开启后可在时间推进中保持稳定标度。比较不同运行的幅值时，可使用手动标度。"},
{"Select a trace or receiver row","选择单道或接收排"},
{"Receiver traces can show a single three-component trace, all receivers, one X row or one Y row. A captured record keeps its original geometry even when you edit the next receiver spread.","地震记录可显示单道三分量、全部接收点、一排 X 向记录或一排 Y 向记录。编辑下一次接收排列时，已采集记录仍保留原始几何信息。"},
{"Enhance weak arrivals with AGC","用 AGC 增强弱信号"},
{"Open Trace options and enable Automatic gain compensation. Adjust window, strength, maximum boost and noise floor. Start with 120 ms and 20-50x maximum boost. AGC changes relative display amplitudes; SEG-Y exports use original samples.","打开波形选项并启用自动增益补偿，调整时间窗、补偿强度、最大放大量与噪声门限。可先使用 120 毫秒、最大 20–50 倍。AGC 改变显示的相对振幅；SEG-Y 导出仍使用原始样本。"},
{"Select an uncompressed ASCII .vts StructuredGrid with physical XYZ points and PointData Vp, Vs, Density in SI units. Import requires an equal-spacing Cartesian grid with origin (0,0,0). Curved grids must be resampled. Click Validate + import 3D model to apply.","选择未压缩 ASCII .vts，包含 SI 单位 XYZ 坐标及 Vp、Vs、Density 节点物性。当前求解器要求原点为 (0,0,0) 的等距正交网格，曲网格需先重采样。点击校验并导入三维模型生效。"},
{"Model export uses VTK StructuredGrid (.vts) only. Choose model output selects an independent filename. The initialized physical grid, Vp, Vs and Density are exported without CPML or ghosts; Z is positive depth. Existing files are preserved.","三维模型统一导出 VTK StructuredGrid（.vts）。选择独立输出文件名，保存当前生效物理网格及 Vp、Vs、密度；不含 CPML 或虚点，Z 向下为深度。已有文件不会覆盖。"},
{"Choose record filenames","选择地震记录文件名"},
{"Acquisition provides Browse export folder, Shot file prefix and Choose export name / location. A prefix named survey produces survey_0001_vx.sgy, survey_0001_vy.sgy, survey_0001_vz.sgy and survey_0001_geometry.csv.","数据采集提供浏览导出文件夹、单炮文件名前缀和选择导出名称与位置。前缀 survey 将生成 survey_0001_vx.sgy、survey_0001_vy.sgy、survey_0001_vz.sgy 和 survey_0001_geometry.csv。"},
{"Organize exports and import records","组织导出与导入记录"},
{"Create session subfolder keeps each capture or spread in a timestamped folder. Turn it off to write directly into the selected folder. Existing files require another name. Import shot record opens SEG-Y independently of the GPU model.","创建会话子文件夹将每次单炮或多炮采集放入带时间戳的文件夹。关闭后直接写入所选文件夹；遇到已有文件需要更换名称。导入地震记录可独立于 GPU 模型打开 SEG-Y。"},
{"Slice navigation","剖面操作"},
{"Wheel zooms the entire section about its center; middle drag pans; left click links orthogonal slice positions. Reset view fits one slice; Reset views or R fits all slices.","滚轮以剖面中心整体缩放，中键拖动平移，左键点击联动正交剖面位置。重置视图恢复单剖面；重置全部视图或 R 键恢复全部剖面。"},
{"Volume navigation","体视图操作"},
{"Left drag orbits, right drag zooms and middle drag pans. Reset camera restores the initial camera. Volume gain, density and sampling quality can be adjusted independently of slice colors.","左键拖动旋转、右键拖动缩放、中键拖动平移。重置相机恢复初始视角。体渲染增益、密度和采样质量可独立于剖面颜色进行调整。"},
{"Docking and language","停靠布局与语言"},
{"Drag a window tab to dock or rearrange panels. Workspace presets restore useful layouts. The language selector changes interface text without resetting the simulation or display parameters.","拖动窗口标签可停靠或重排面板，工作区预设用于恢复布局。切换语言只改变界面文字，不会重置模拟或显示参数。"},
{"If the record is empty","记录为空时的检查"},
{"Confirm the model is initialized, receivers are deployed and the source is inside the model. Run supplies live data; Capture creates exportable samples. Check the selected data source, component, gain and plot fit.","确认模型已初始化、接收排列已部署且震源位于模型内部。运行提供实时数据，采集生成可导出样本。检查所选数据来源、分量、增益及图形适配。"},

