{"STEP %d | t %.4f s | %.0f FPS","步数 %d | 时间 %.4f s | %.0f FPS"},
{"2D model and time step","二维模型与时步"},
{"Open the 2D sandbox. Use Simulation to set grid size, spacing, time step and PML; use Model Edit or Model I/O to define the medium. Changing the grid clears the physical model. Keep dt within the displayed safe limit.","进入二维沙盒。在模拟页设置网格、间距、时步和 PML，在模型编辑或模型文件页定义介质。修改网格会清空物理模型；请将 dt 控制在界面显示的安全范围内。"},
{"2D source and capture","二维震源与采集"},
{"Set the source before recording. In Data Export, deploy a receiver line and choose TRIGGER & ACQUIRE for a new shot, or START CAPTURE to record the running fields on a new local timeline. Model, source and receiver edits are disabled during capture.","采集前设置震源。在数据导出页布设接收线，选择“激发并采集”获取新炮，或选择“开始采集”在独立的局部时间轴上记录当前波场。采集期间禁止修改模型、震源和接收排列。"},
{"2D seismic record viewer","二维地震记录查看器"},
{"Record viewer opens a frozen Vz/Vx snapshot. Browse SEG-Y and Import shot for display load external data independently. Choose Receiver section or Single trace, then adjust selection and Trace options.","地震记录查看器打开冻结的 Vz/Vx 快照。浏览 SEG-Y 并导入单炮可独立加载外部数据。选择多道记录或单道，再调整道选择和波形选项。"},
{"2D gain and reset behavior","二维增益与重置规则"},
{"Trace gain controls wiggle width; Heatmap range controls density saturation. AGC enhances weak arrivals in a display copy. Component changes and imports retain these settings. Reset View fits the plot; Reset viewer display restores presentation defaults only.","波形增益控制波形宽度，密度图范围控制颜色饱和度。AGC 在显示副本上增强弱信号。切换分量或导入数据保留这些设置；恢复视图只调整坐标范围，重置查看器显示参数才会恢复显示默认值。"},
{"Detailed 2D documentation","详细二维文档"},
{"The repository includes docs/user/Seis2D_User_Guide.md with real CUDA screenshots, a model-to-recording workflow, SEG-Y limits and troubleshooting. Code organization and regression results are in docs/development/SEIS2D_REFACTOR_AND_VIEWER.md.","仓库 docs/user/Seis2D_User_Guide.md 包含实际 CUDA 截图、模型至采集全流程、SEG-Y 限制和问题排查。代码组织及回归结果见 docs/development/SEIS2D_REFACTOR_AND_VIEWER.md。"},
