{"500/20/500","500×20×500"},
{"Isolated workspace / CPML / Up to 500 channels","独立工作区  /  CPML  /  最多 500 道"},
{"At edited f0: %.1f solver steps / period","按待应用主频：每周期 %.1f 个求解步"},
{"Capture: %.3f ms interval | %.3f s duration","采集：间隔 %.3f ms | 时长 %.3f s"},
{"Edited f0 reaches the recording Nyquist limit; reduce sample stride or frequency.","待应用主频达到记录奈奎斯特上限，请减小采样步数间隔或主频。"},
{"Wavelet peak falls outside the requested capture window; increase samples or frequency.","子波峰值超出当前采集时间窗，请增加样点数或主频。"},
{"Fewer than 10 solver steps per dominant period; time resolution may be insufficient.","主频每周期不足 10 个求解步，时间分辨率可能不足。"},
{"Choose the 3D card on Home. The initial grid is 300 x 50 x 300, with 100 receivers per X line and 5 Y rows (500 total). Acquisition defaults to one shot with 1000 samples, and the receiver limit is 500. The initial view uses Vz, Paper scientific and Coolwarm; Hold observed peak is off.","在首页选择三维沙盒。默认网格 300×50×300，X 向每排 100 道、Y 向 5 排，共 500 道；默认单炮激发，每炮 1000 样点，接收总上限 500 道。初始显示 Vz、论文浅色和 Coolwarm，历史峰值保持关闭。"},
{"In Source, set XYZ, source mechanism, amplitude and direction. Source depth must be at least two cells. Source wavelet and Simulation share a pending Ricker frequency. Apply frequency + reset fields or a new capture updates the source and CPML while preserving the model and display gain.","在震源页设置 XYZ、机制、幅度和方向，深度至少两格。震源子波与模拟页共用待应用主频。应用主频并重置波场或开始新采集时，同步更新震源与 CPML，保留模型和显示增益。"},
{"200 cubed","200×200×200"},
{"Maximum physical grid: X x Y x Z <= 36,000,000; each axis >= 16. VRAM and texture limits also apply.","物理网格上限：X×Y×Z≤3600 万，各轴至少 16 点；还需满足显存和纹理尺寸限制。"},
{"SOURCE WAVELET","震源子波"},
{"Active frequency: %.2f Hz | delay %.3f ms","已生效主频：%.2f Hz | 子波延迟 %.3f ms"},
{"Frequency edit pending; current wavefield uses the active value.","主频修改尚未应用；当前波场仍使用已生效值。"},
{"Apply frequency, Reset wavefield + fire, or Capture applies the wavelet and CPML together. Run resumes the active wavefield.","应用主频、重发震源或开始采集时同步更新子波和 CPML；运行/暂停继续当前波场。"},
{"Apply frequency + reset fields","应用主频并重置波场"},
{"Source frequency and CPML applied; fields reset. Model, receivers and display settings retained.","主频与 CPML 已同步应用，波场已清零；模型、接收排列和显示参数已保留。"},
{"Default: 100 X receivers in 5 Y rows (500 total). Fit spread centers the mesh; smaller grids reduce the fitted count.","默认 X 向每排 100 道、Y 向 5 排，共 500 道。适配排列使面阵居中；较小网格会减少实际道数。"},
{"2D docked workspace","二维停靠工作区"},
{"Use Workspace to choose Modeling, Wavefield + records or Record focus. Drag panel tabs to arrange controls, canvas and records. Layout changes retain model, raw records and display gain. Wheel zoom and middle-drag pan remain available during capture.","使用工作区选择建模、波场与记录对照或记录分析布局。拖动页签可排列参数、波场和记录窗口。切换布局保留模型、原始记录和显示增益；采集时仍可滚轮缩放、中键平移。"},
{"2D shot package export","二维单炮数据包导出"},
{"Data Export lets you choose an output folder and package basename, including Unicode paths. Each shot creates a new folder with raw Vx/Vz SEG-Y, geometry and a hash manifest; CSV and frozen model/source arrays are optional. Existing packages are never overwritten. A package is not a restart checkpoint.","数据导出可选择文件夹和数据包名称，支持中文路径。每炮建立新目录，包含原始 Vx/Vz SEG-Y、几何和校验清单，可选 CSV 与冻结模型/子波数组。已有数据包不覆盖；数据包不是求解重启检查点。"},

