{"Solver wall time includes CUDA synchronization; display and file export are excluded.","求解耗时包含 CUDA 同步，不含显示与文件导出。"},
{"Compare identical models, sources and time steps in isolated fields. Lower time is faster; relative L2 checks the resulting Vz wavefield.","使用独立波场对比相同模型、震源和时间步。耗时越低越快；相对 L2 误差用于核对 Vz 波场。"},
{"Changing grid dimensions rebuilds the material model and clears the wavefield. Updating time or backend clears the wavefield and retains materials.","修改网格尺寸将重建物性模型并清空波场；更新时间参数或计算核心会清空波场并保留物性。"},
{"Imported records and capture snapshots use the same viewer. Original samples are retained.","导入记录与采集快照共用查看器，保留原始采样数据。"},
{"Batch wall time includes receiver sampling and synchronization; display and export are excluded.","每批耗时包含检波器采样和同步，不含显示与导出。"},
{"Standard 32 cubed comparison: identical material recipe, source, spacing and dt; CPML width 8. Four warm-up steps and twenty timed steps. Live data is retained.","32³ 标准对比：采用相同物性方案、震源、间距和时间步，CPML 宽度为 8。预热 4 步，计时 20 步，保留当前模拟数据。"},

{"Trace range","道范围"},
{"2D and 3D offer Auto, CPU / OpenMP and CUDA. Apply the backend after selecting CPU workers. Auto falls back to CPU when CUDA or graphics interop is unavailable. Switching rebuilds the session; stop acquisition first.","二维和三维均提供自动、CPU / OpenMP 与 CUDA。选择 CPU 线程数后应用核心；CUDA 或图形互操作不可用时自动回退 CPU。切换会重建会话，请先停止采集。"},
{"The parameter tab beside controls compares active values with unapplied drafts. Update parameters applies edits; changing dimensions rebuilds the model. Discard pending changes restores 2D drafts. Acquisition locks rebuild actions.","控制面板旁的参数页签对照生效值与待应用草稿。更新参数应用修改，尺寸变化会重建模型；撤销待应用参数可恢复二维草稿。采集中禁止重建。"},
{"2D benchmarks an isolated copy of the current model. 3D uses a 32 cubed standard model with CPML 8. Both exclude four warm-up steps and time twenty steps, reporting CPU/CUDA time ratio and Vz relative L2 error. Raw live data is retained.","二维对当前模型的独立副本计时；三维采用 32³、CPML 8 标准模型。均预热 4 步、计时 20 步，报告 CPU/CUDA 耗时比和 Vz 相对 L2 误差，保留当前原始数据。"},
