{"Use VTI as the primary 2D/3D model format: one file contains Vp, Vs, Density and spacing. In 2D, SEG-Y property groups remain available for external exchange. Receiver time series use SEG-Y. Loading a model resets the wavefield.","二维、三维物性模型首选 VTI，单文件包含 Vp、Vs、密度和间距。二维保留 SEG-Y 物性组交换接口；接收器时间序列使用 SEG-Y。加载模型会重置波场。"},

{"Import a model","导入模型"},
{"Select an uncompressed raw-appended or ASCII VTI ImageData with PointData Vp, Vs, Density in SI units. Import requires an equal-spacing Cartesian grid with origin (0,0,0). Curved grids must be resampled. Click Validate + import 3D model to apply.","选择未压缩 raw-appended 或 ASCII VTI ImageData，节点字段为 SI 单位的 Vp、Vs、Density。要求零原点、等距直角网格；曲网格需先重采样。选择文件后点击校验并导入三维模型。"},

{"Export a model","导出模型"},
{"Model export uses VTK ImageData (.vti). Choose model output selects an independent filename. The initialized physical grid, Vp, Vs and Density are exported without CPML or ghosts; Z is positive depth. Existing files are preserved.","模型导出使用 VTK ImageData（.vti）。选择独立的新输出文件名，保存已初始化物理网格与 Vp、Vs、密度；不含 CPML 或 ghost，Z 向下为正。已有文件不会覆盖。"},

